Package: dragonfruit-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dragonfruit Developers <dragonfruit@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/dragonfruit-desktop/dragonfruit
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: @RECOMMENDS@
Suggests: @SUGGESTS@
Description: Modern Wayland desktop environment
 Dragonfruit is a Wayland desktop environment built with Rust and Qt Quick.
 .
 This package installs the compositor, shell, session services, Settings,
 Files, and the XDG desktop portal backend. It installs alongside another
 desktop; choose Dragonfruit at the login screen.
 .
 This is an early binary release asset. Official Debian packaging and policy
 review are tracked separately (T165).
